usage: 
packager create-gbs --rbf=<RBF_PATH> --afu-json=<AFU_JSON_PATH> --gbs=<NAME_FOR_GBS> --set-value <key>:<value>

packager create-gbs

Options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --rbf RBF             RBF file (REQUIRED)
  --afu-json AFU_JSON   AFU JSON file that contains metadata
  --no-metadata         Empty metadata section will be appended
  --gbs GBS             Output location for gbs file. Default is
                        <rbf_name>.gbs
  --set-value [SET_VALUE ...]
                        set values for keys in JSON metadata as <key>:<value>.
                        Can be followed by more than one <key>:<value> pairs.
